span begin="00:25.930" end="00:26.620">keys</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.650" end="00:29.200"><span begin="00:26.650" end="00:26.920">Had </span><span begin="00:26.920" end="00:26.980">a </span><span begin="00:26.980" end="00:27.370">pretty </span><span begin="00:27.370" end="00:27.850">boy </span><span begin="00:27.850" end="00:28.060">over </span><span begin="00:28.060" end="00:28.330">but </span><span begin="00:28.330" end="00:28.390">he </span><span begin="00:28.390" end="00:28.750">couldn't </span><span begin="00:28.750" end="00:29.200">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.500" end="00:32.740"><span begin="00:29.500" end="00:29.710">On </span><span begin="00:29.710" end="00:29.920">his </span><span begin="00:29.920" end="00:30.310">way </span><span begin="00:30.310" end="00:30.580">out</span><span begin="00:30.580" end="00:30.580">, </span><span begin="00:30.580" end="00:30.820">made </span><span begin="00:30.820" end="00:30.910">him </span><span begin="00:30.910" end="00:31.180">sign </span><span begin="00:31.180" end="00:31.390">an </span><span begin="00:31.390" end="00:31.570">NDA</span><span begin="00:31.570" end="00:32.350">, </span><span begin="00:32.350" end="00:32.740">mm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.060" end="00:41.440"><span begin="00:40.060" end="00:40.360">Yeah</span><span begin="00:40.360" end="00:40.360">, </span><span begin="00:40.360" end="00:40.420">I </span><span begin="00:40.420" end="00:40.570">made </span><span begin="00:40.570" end="00:40.780">him </span><span begin="00:40.780" end="00:41.080">sign </span><span begin="00:41.080" end="00:41.350">an </span><span begin="00:41.350" end="00:41.440">NDA</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.900" end="00:45.430"><span begin="00:43.900" end="00:44.410">Once </span><span begin="00:44.410" end="00:44.680">was </span><span begin="00:44.680" end="00:45.040">good </span><span begin="00:45.040" end="00:45.430">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.460" end="